# Berserker Stance and the Whirlwind weapon: The Islander and The Affray
# (1718, 1719, level 30), The Windwatcher (1791), Cyclonian with Essence of
# the Exile (1712, 1714), The Summoning (1713) and Whirlwind Weapon (1792,
# level 40).
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json, objects.json and items.json for the chain,
# objectives (8 Liferoot, 30 Bloodscalp Tusks, 8 of each charm), drops and
# places; the knowledge base's drop table (Burning Charm 34%, Thundering 39%,
# Cresting 32%, Bloodscalp Tusk 37% from every Bloodscalp, Kurzen Medicine
# Man Liferoot 8%, Whirlwind Heart 100%) and vendor table (Liferoot, one in
# stock per vendor, two hours to restock: forever-tdb npc_vendor); quest-notes
# for the Affray (10-minute timer, the grate, challengers 15-20 s apart, Big
# Will level 33 and neutral, Demoralizing Shout), the sand bar, Tarren Mill's
# guards, the exiles' levels and spells, the charms' banish use and
# Cyclonian (level 40 elite, Whirlwind, Gust of Wind, Knock Away, nature
# damage, abandon and retake after a failed fight); Forever's Warrior class
# quest list (data/local/quest-audit/): The Affray now teaches Berserker
# Stance; Whirlwind Weapon lets you choose the Whirlwind Axe, Sword or
# Warhammer.
# The leveling guides take The Islander and The Affray on the route
# (alliance/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills and 40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale;
# horde/30-40/04-dustwallow-marsh); they are repeated here for anyone off it.
# The rest is left out of the leveling guides: it ends in an elite fight and
# runs from the Barrens to Alterac, Arathi and Stranglethorn.
# ASSUMED: the Affray's challengers, Bath'rah's ritual and Cyclonian's fight are as in Classic (Classic flow; Forever's data has no event data above 30). In-game check: six challengers before Big Will, and Cyclonian appearing when The Summoning is accepted.

step The Islander (Stormwind)
  only Human,NightElf,Skyborne,Alliance
  zone Stormwind City
  tip At 30, Wu Shen, beside Ilsa Corbin in the warrior trainers' building of Old Town, sends you to Klannoc Macleod on Fray Island in the Barrens.
  level 30
  accept 1718 npc 5479                        -- Wu Shen

